{
    "title": "Ultimate Cribbage: Card Board",
    "description": "How fast can you become the Ultimate Cribbage board game pro? Train your card skills against increasing offline difficulties and reach 121 points before your online opponent and friends! The cards are on the table, and it is time to show your skills in one of the most popular card games in the world, Cribbage (Crib)!\r\n\r\nWhether you are a Cribbage pro or an absolute beginner playing with friends, Ultimate Classic Cribbage Board will scratch that classic card game itch. If you\u2019re a fan of Solitaire, Monopoly, Uno, Backgammon, Phase 10, Gin Rummy, Yahtzee, Skip Bo, Euchre, or Hearts, join the free Ultimate Cribbage club now! Over 4-star rating means this is the best Cribbage game available. \r\n\r\nClubs, Diamonds, Hearts, or spades! Use the correct card to get a monopoly on the wins. With a mixture of chance and strategy, each game will be totally different, always guaranteeing maximum entertainment. This is not a casino game like poker, bingo, or blackjack. \r\n\r\n \u2022 Beautiful & intuitive. Easy to read Hoyle cards and suitable for all ages & skill levels. Play cribbage with grandpa or kids! \r\n \u2022 Multiple difficulty levels! Can you become the next Cribbage Board Master? \r\n \u2022 Cribbage Newbie? Automatic scorekeeping will help you learn the best card strategies to maximize your hand & crib points. You won\u2019t need a cribbage calculator for this one. Your friends will wonder how you got so good!\r\n \u2022 Cribbage Pro? Submit your jd & play it the classic way and count points manually. Keep that brain sharp, you card shark!\r\n \u2022 Detailed crib, hand, and play score breakdowns every round. Use the automatic counter and watch that peg move around the crib pegboard. \r\n \u2022 Choose between Classic Cribbage, Muggins, and Shotgun Cribbage variants.\r\n \u2022 Ace our daily Cribbage app challenges like a true pro for in-game rewards.\r\n\u2022 Traveling? Look no more for a travel cribbage app. Play anywhere you go. \r\n\r\nEnjoy the classic card game that friends, family and grandpas have been enjoying for decades. Replace Pinochle, Old Maid, Canasta, Catan, Whist, Brainium or Yahtzee with classic cribbage as your new two-player game. If you're a score keeper on table game nights then this is the classic game to show your friends. Make it your official card party game. Install the free Ultimate Cribbage app today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "How fast can you become the Ultimate Cribbage board game pro? Train your card skills against increasing offline difficulties and reach 121 points before your online opponent and friends! The cards are on the table, and it is time to show your skills in one of the most popular card games in the world, Cribbage (Crib)!<br><br>Whether you are a Cribbage pro or an absolute beginner playing with friends, Ultimate Classic Cribbage Board will scratch that classic card game itch. If you\u2019re a fan of Solitaire, Monopoly, Uno, Backgammon, Phase 10, Gin Rummy, Yahtzee, Skip Bo, Euchre, or Hearts, join the free Ultimate Cribbage club now! Over 4-star rating means this is the best Cribbage game available. <br><br>Clubs, Diamonds, Hearts, or spades! Use the correct card to get a monopoly on the wins. With a mixture of chance and strategy, each game will be totally different, always guaranteeing maximum entertainment. This is not a casino game like poker, bingo, or blackjack. <br><br> \u2022 Beautiful &amp; intuitive. Easy to read Hoyle cards and suitable for all ages &amp; skill levels. Play cribbage with grandpa or kids! <br> \u2022 Multiple difficulty levels! Can you become the next Cribbage Board Master? <br> \u2022 Cribbage Newbie? Automatic scorekeeping will help you learn the best card strategies to maximize your hand &amp; crib points. You won\u2019t need a cribbage calculator for this one. Your friends will wonder how you got so good!<br> \u2022 Cribbage Pro? Submit your jd &amp; play it the classic way and count points manually. Keep that brain sharp, you card shark!<br> \u2022 Detailed crib, hand, and play score breakdowns every round. Use the automatic counter and watch that peg move around the crib pegboard. <br> \u2022 Choose between Classic Cribbage, Muggins, and Shotgun Cribbage variants.<br> \u2022 Ace our daily Cribbage app challenges like a true pro for in-game rewards.<br>\u2022 Traveling? Look no more for a travel cribbage app. Play anywhere you go. <br><br>Enjoy the classic card game that friends, family and grandpas have been enjoying for decades. Replace Pinochle, Old Maid, Canasta, Catan, Whist, Brainium or Yahtzee with classic cribbage as your new two-player game. If you&#39;re a score keeper on table game nights then this is the classic game to show your friends. Make it your official card party game. Install the free Ultimate Cribbage app today!",
